    "notes": { "value": "Try increasing the Count. \n\nNote the **Attribute Expressions** (π) added to the **Size (W)** and **Size (Y)** attributes to calculate the resulting width/height of a diamond equal to the **Width** of the **Square**.", "varType": "string" },
